OL,3,GNEWSAMP attacks Reform plans to axe
OL,4,Aswimming pool plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to scrap plans for a new
OL,7,Fswimming pool in Bradford was a
OL,8,F"political one" that "Reform must take
OL,9,Fresponsibility for", an MP has said.
OL,11,FBradford East Labour MP Imran Hussain
OL,12,Fcriticised the decision by the
OL,13,FReform-led authority to cancel the
OL,14,Fdevelopment of the #32m leisure centre
OL,15,Fon Squire Lane in Girlington.
OL,17,FA government grant of #20m was
OL,18,Fconditional on it being used for the
OL,19,Fcentre, first approved in 2019m and is
OL,20,Fnow expected to be returned.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
